{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id555958865"}, "name":{"label":"kiokulous"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-22T20:44:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.193"}, "id":{"label":"13877328868"}, "title":{"label":"403 error"}, "content":{"label":"I’m updating my review from 2 stars to 4. After being contacted by the support team, I did some digging and found that the \"login/edit\" issue was actually a 403 error specific to my local network provider (Vinaphone). The app works flawlessly on other networks.\nOnce the network compatibility is fully smoothed out, it’s definitely a 5-star travel app for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=1476732439&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id348275425"}, "name":{"label":"Luong La"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-04T19:37:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.167"}, "id":{"label":"12737164207"}, "title":{"label":"Really handy app"}, "content":{"label":"It helps me a lot while planning trips. The most useful feature , I think, is optimising trip in a day. I think it is worth to pay (having monthly subscription would be better since I don't travel whole year). However, I would love to see app can help me to arrange base on morning and afternoon periods instead of the whole day since a nap is needed in afternoon.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=1476732439&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id594571370"}, "name":{"label":"Tran Phuong Thao Ngoc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-27T18:40:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.166"}, "id":{"label":"12706097231"}, "title":{"label":"Coolest trip planning app ever!!!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried so many ways to plan trips, and I’m a type A person so I’m not easily pleased, but Wanderlog is such a helpful app that I have to come here and leave a 5-star review. The built in map is so convenient, the, and the itinerary plan has helped me manage my travelling days easily. Customer service is also great, I emailed them for an issue and got it resolved within 2 hours. Highly recommended for those oldest thot daughters who plan family trips out there 🙆🏻‍♀️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=1476732439&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
